# Supply Chain Analytics – Demand Forecasting & Anomaly Detection

## Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing supply chain sales and inventory data to forecast future demand and detect operational anomalies.

The objective is to improve inventory planning and support data-driven supply chain decisions using statistical analysis and machine learning techniques.

---

## Dataset

The dataset contains:

* Date
* Store ID
* Product ID
* Category
* Region
* Inventory Level
* Units Sold
* Units Ordered
* Demand Forecast
* Price
* Discount
* Weather Condition
* Holiday/Promotion
* Competitor Pricing
* Seasonality

Total Records: 73,100

